OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's care spending hits
OL,4,Acouncil costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FRising costs for children in care have
OL,7,Fled to a council forecasting it will
OL,8,Fspend more than it budgeted for in the
OL,9,Fcurrent financial year,
OL,11,FCheshire West and Chester Council is
OL,12,Fforecasting an overspend of more than
OL,13,F#10m for the year to 31 March 2027.
OL,15,FIt said the highest overspend was in
OL,16,Fits children and families department as
OL,17,Fthe average cost of each looked after
OL,18,Fchild reached #83,000 - up from #69,000
OL,19,Foriginally budgeted.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
